268
00:09:14,433 --> 00:09:15,533
<b>under any reasonable</b>

269
00:09:15,533 --> 00:09:17,000
<b>interpretation of the Treaty of</b>

270
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:19,433
<b>Tordesillas. Portugal didn't push the</b>

271
00:09:19,433 --> 00:09:20,833
<b>line slightly, they</b>

272
00:09:20,833 --> 00:09:22,366
<b>almost doubled the country.</b>

273
00:09:22,666 --> 00:09:25,633
<b>The treaty gave Portugal a foothold. 60</b>

