00:12:34,966 --> 00:12:35,866
<b>working on a full deep</b>

370
00:12:35,866 --> 00:12:37,166
<b>dive on the treaty itself.</b>

371
00:12:38,133 --> 00:12:39,433
<b>What it says, what it</b>

